<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan group to tender for 54,000 tonnes corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan group to tender for 54,000 tonnes corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn-buying group will tender on Wednesday for a shipment of 54,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprise and Ever Smile Feed Mill Co.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>			U.S. Gulf  Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>   One    54,000  Nov 10-25  Nov 26-Dec 9</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
